  The fiery blade burns the ape! 

  The fiery blade burns the ape! You kill the ape. 

  "SHIFT + O" Adjust pickup types and autopickup exceptions.

  "SHIFT + @" Auto pickup ON!

  Step forward. Which simultaneously picks up the ape corpse. I'm
