  You kill the lieutenant! The long worm bites! The long worm bites!
The long worm bites!

  WOW! It must have rolled three 20's in a row! (*) 

  Look at status screen. 

  HP:124(124)

  Okay!!! The long worm can stay in the doorway for ever! I'll even
